// FLOW-MATIC - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

// FLOW-MATIC is the COBOL ancestor IBM wrote the
// COBOL report on. Its program is a set of DISPLAY verbs.
//
//     IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
//     PROGRAM-ID. HELLO.
//     PROCEDURE DIVISION.
//         DISPLAY 'HELLO WORLD'.
